      "vehicle": "veh-3",
      "geofence": "depot-north",
      "type": "exit",
      "at": "2024-06-11T09:15:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

We need the ACTUAL geofence CROSSING for veh-3. This is an event with type "exit" (a crossing). The user asked for event ref, which geofence it was, and crossing type. So event_ref = "gfe-5511-aa02", geofence = "depot-north", crossing_type = "exit". We need to present exactly as a JSON object in a code block.

